	// in the original A. That causes poor spatial locality.
	//
	// Here we keep A in its original row-major layout and instead
	// restructure the traversal:
	//
	//   for j in 0..N-1:
	//     tmp = beta * y[j];
	//     for i in 0..N-1:
	//       x[i] += tmp * A[j][i];
